          "id": 30,
          "hub_id": 14880,
          "version": "2.0.0",
          "description": "**If updating please delete existing files. (BepInEx/plugins/SPTBattleAmbience &amp; BepInEx/config/com.pein.battleambience.cfg)**\n\n- Significant rewrite of the mod's core functionality - each map has their own event configurations, ambience events can happen simultaneously and ovelap, events can have time of day restrictions and more. Modders are now able to create their own configuration presets, import their own sounds, create new sound categories and sound types.\n- Added helicopter ambient events to Customs, Streets, Reserve and Ground Zero.\n\nLet me know if something is broken",
          "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2264/battle-ambience/2.0.0",
          "content_length": null,
